Bundled third-party material
----------------------------

data/asciidoctor-default.css
    The Asciidoctor default stylesheet (MIT License), copied unmodified from
    Asciidoctor 2.0.26. It is embedded into standalone HTML output exactly as
    Asciidoctor embeds it.

testdata/upstream, testdata/docs, testdata/realworld (except asciidoctor-pdf)
    AsciiDoc snippets extracted from the Asciidoctor test suite, the
    Asciidoctor documentation, README, CHANGELOG and test fixtures
    (MIT License, see above).

testdata/docbook/standalone/rw-*
    Copies of the Asciidoctor README, CHANGELOG, man page and syntax
    reference (MIT License, see above) converted with the DocBook backend.

testdata/realworld/asciidoctor-pdf
    Documentation sources of Asciidoctor PDF
    (https://github.com/asciidoctor/asciidoctor-pdf), MIT License,
    Copyright (C) 2014-present OpenDevise Inc. and the Asciidoctor Project.

The expected .html and .xml files under testdata/ were generated by Asciidoctor 2.0.26.
